{
  "id": "DEU.13",
  "number": "13",
  "bookId": "DEU",
  "reference": "Deuteronomy 13",
  "verseCount": 18,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "13",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DEU 13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "13",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Prophets or interpreters of dreams may promise a miracle or a wonder, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in order to lead you to worship and serve gods that you have not worshipped before. Even if what they promise comes true, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "do not pay any attention to them. The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God is using them to test you, to see if you love the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " with all your heart. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Follow the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " and honour him; obey him and keep his commands; worship him and be faithful to him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.5.12+1CO.5.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Cor 5.12–13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But put to death any interpreters of dreams or prophets who tell you to rebel against the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", who rescued you from Egypt, where you were slaves. Such people are evil and are trying to lead you away from the life that the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has commanded you to live. They must be put to death, in order to rid yourselves of this evil.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Even your brother or your son or your daughter or the wife you love or your closest friend may secretly encourage you to worship other gods, gods that you and your ancestors have never worshipped. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "One of them may encourage you to worship the gods of the people who live near you or the gods of those who live far away. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But do not let him or her persuade you; do not even listen to them. Show them no mercy or pity, and do not protect them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kill them! Be the first to stone them, and then let everyone else stone them too. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Stone them to death! They tried to lead you away from the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God, who rescued you from Egypt, where you were slaves. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then all the people of Israel will hear what happened; they will be afraid, and no one will ever again do such an evil thing.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“When you are living in the towns that the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God gives you, you may hear ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that some worthless people of your nation have misled the people of their town to worship gods that you have never worshipped before. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If you hear such a rumour, investigate it thoroughly; and if it is true that this evil thing did happen, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "then kill all the people in that town and all their livestock too. Destroy that town completely. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bring together all the possessions of the people who live there and pile them up in the town square. Then burn the town and everything in it as an offering to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God. It must be left in ruins for ever and never again be rebuilt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Do not keep for yourselves anything that was condemned to destruction, and then the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " will turn from his fierce anger and show you mercy. He will be merciful to you and make you a numerous people, as he promised your ancestors, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "if you obey all his commands that I have given you today, and do what he requires.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "DEU.14",
